{"unit_id":"leotpp__dsh-subagent-toolkit#feature-1","repo":"leotpp/dsh-subagent-toolkit","commit":"8f27e6ed01b5f6a1dbb6b88085e7a5f175ff34b5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-toolkit 的功能「子代理模型路由」：设置页可从模型目录选择一个子代理路由，或选择跟随主模型；保存后写入模型选择设置。 通过设置页保存或子代理任务调用触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:569-675"]}
