{"unit_id":"leotpp__dsh-subagent-toolkit#feature-3","repo":"leotpp/dsh-subagent-toolkit","commit":"8f27e6ed01b5f6a1dbb6b88085e7a5f175ff34b5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-toolkit 的功能「Pi CLI 子任务」：subagent_pi 将非空文本提示传给 Pi CLI 单次运行，并在成功时返回标准输出文本。 通过设置页保存或子代理任务调用触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:48-63"]}
{"unit_id":"leotpp__dsh-subagent-toolkit#feature-4","repo":"leotpp/dsh-subagent-toolkit","commit":"8f27e6ed01b5f6a1dbb6b88085e7a5f175ff34b5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-toolkit 的功能「单路由提示」：当子代理允许名单仅有一个路由时，插件向系统提示词加入 provider、model 及可选推理强度的调用提示。 通过设置页保存或子代理任务调用触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:199-218"]}
